# The world of the first release, on whatever planet has already been created.
#
# Everything setup.4x does except decide which planet it is on. Split out so that
# `/new <size>`, which abandons a game and starts another on a planet of that size, builds
# the same world the release opens with rather than a second description of it.
#
# The twelve territories below exist on every planet size - the smallest Goldberg solid
# has twelve - so this runs on any of them. A larger planet gets the release's twelve and
# bare ground beyond.

run nodes
run forces

# One ark, waiting above the planet. Nothing is on the planet yet.
add ark orbit
